y townhome features quality finishing throughout including quartz counter tops, vinyl plank flooring, ceramic tile backsplash, ceramic tile floors, stainless appliances, & so much more. The open concept main floor has a spacious kitchen with a massive island overlooking the dining room on one end & the stylish living room on the other end. The upper floor features a generous master w/walk in closet and 4 piece ensuite, 2 additional bedrooms, a second upper floor 4 piece bath & the laundry room. This unit features a DOUBLE ATTACHED GARAGE. Enjoy summer days on your spacious rear deck. At this price, what are you waiting for? Come take a peak. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$369,900"],["Type","Townhouse"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,558 sq ft"],["Year built","2026"],["Storeys","3"],["Condo fee","$219 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Trumpeter Area"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5S0N1"],["MLS® number","E4517338"],["Listed","November 23, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Garage door opener"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level",""]],"courtesy":"Moe Charara, Royal Lepage Arteam Realty and Ray Elwenni, Royal Lepage Arteam Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"trumpeter","area":"west-edmonton"}